        "original_id": "b3d2fd95-6a8f-54ab-ac54-c593a9aaee62",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bugsy Siegel, Mickey Cohen, David Berman, Harold \"Hooky\" Rothman, Moe Sedway, Jack Dragna, Gus Greenbaum\n- Places: Los Angeles, Las Vegas\n- Organizations: Cohen crime family, L.A. family\n- Products: Flamingo Hotel & Casino\n- Topics: Illegal gambling, prostitution, Siegel's murder\n\nFacts:\n- Bugsy Siegel ran illegal gambling and prostitution operations in Los Angeles and later Las Vegas.\n- Bugsy Siegel worked with his lieutenants Mickey Cohen, David Berman, Harold \"Hooky\" Rothman, and Moe Sedway in those operations.\n- Jack Dragna was the boss of the L.A. family involved alongside Bugsy Siegel's operations.\n- After Bugsy Siegel's murder, Moe Sedway and Gus Greenbaum made the Flamingo Hotel & Casino in Las Vegas very successful.",
